{{apichanges|10.1.0|prev=10.0.7|next=10.1.5}}

==Summary==
* A new [[#Private Auras|Private Auras]] system has been added to display buffs and debuffs applied to units without exposing information about the aura to addons.
* A new [[Hyperlinks#addon|addon]] link type has been added for local addon-only chat links.
* A new [[Hyperlinks#talentbuild|talentbuild]] link type has been added for inspecting loadouts.
* A new [[#Scroll Templates|ScrollFrame template]] has been added as a replacement for various other templates which are now deprecated.
* A new set of TOC metadata fields have been added to control the display of an icon in the addon list.
* A new set of TOC metadata fields have been added to automatically register dropdown entries into the minimap [[Addon compartment]].
* The addon list no longer displays addons out-of-order if their names contain [[UI escape sequences]].
* The C_TooltipInfo APIs now return data with all data and line arguments surfaced, removing the need to call <code>TooltipUtil.SurfaceArgs()</code>.
* The {{api|t=e|TOOLTIP_DATA_UPDATE}} event now has an additional <code>dataInstanceID</code> argument. This can be correlated with a field of the same name on tables returned by the C_TooltipInfo APIs to more accurately process data update events.

